1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:02,640
(Sheldon:)how much lunch money
has been taken from us?

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:04,400
(Sheldon:)How many kites?

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,150
(Sheldon:)How many Scooby-Doo
Trapper Keepers?

4
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,280
(Raj:)I totally had one of those.

5
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:10,690
(Sheldon:)Of course you did.

6
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:13,220
(Sheldon:)It was a fun and practical way
of organizing your school work.

7
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,570
(Sheldon:)But the bullies
took it from us.

8
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,560
(Sheldon:)Well, no more.

9
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,730
(Sheldon:)Tonight, we take back
our dignity,

10
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,830
(Sheldon:)our birthright and our pride.

11
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,000
(Sheldon:)What do you say?

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,500
(Sheldon:)Who's with me?

13
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,370
(Raj:)I have a hip-hop aerobics class
at 5:00; could we go after?

14
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,340
(Amy:)Sure.

15
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,210
(Howard:)Also, tonight's the Sabbath

16
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,780
(Howard:)and my mother and I
have a tradition of

17
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,980
lighting the candles and
watching Wheel of Fortune, so...

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,010
If we could leave

19
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,320
at 8:00, we'd still be able to

20
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,920
regain our birthright
at 10:00, 10:30 latest.

21
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,020
(Policeman:)Fine.

22
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:47,320
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

23
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,990
Oh, geez, I-I don't know
if I can ditch Priya

24
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,330
(Leonard:)two nights in a row.

25
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:52,490
(Raj:)Oh, come on, man.

26
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:55,160
(Raj:)Bros before...

27
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)...my sister.

